# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PROJECT SOURCE MEDIA — NEVER COMMIT
#
# ASSETS/ holds the full-quality masters (~250 MB, ~233 MB of it video).
# The mockup HTML files carry that same media base64-embedded; home-page-mockup
# is ~294 MB, which is over GitHub's hard 100 MB per-file limit and WILL cause
# a rejected push. Optimized derivatives in public/ are what belong in the repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/ASSETS/
*-mockup.html

# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
